    .string "special-form"
.L17846:
    .string "(when cond body ...)"
.L17847:
    .string "Lazy one-armed conditional; the absent arm yields unit. A special form, so `body` is evaluated only when `cond` holds. Written `(when cond)` before a match arm's body, it is a guard."
.L17848:
    .string "while"
.L17849:
    .string "special-form"
.L17850:
    .string "(while cond body)"
.L17851:
    .string "Loop while `cond` holds."
