    .string "for"
.L17853:
    .string "special-form"
.L17854:
    .string "(for (i start) condition body)"
.L17855:
    .string "Loop while `condition` holds, rebinding `i` each turn: `(for (i 0) (< i n) body)`. The binding may be bare -- `(for (i) (< i n) body)` starts at 0."
